Hoplane is an original implementation. Its feature set was informed by
other open-source link shorteners, but it contains no code from them.

Attribution links to Kitgenix.com and the Kitgenix GitHub must remain visible
on every HTML page a deployment serves (see LICENSE, section 2). The links are
defined in src/shared/attribution.ts and are checked by the test suite.

Third-party packages used at runtime: Hono (MIT), Zod (MIT), React (MIT),
wouter (Unlicense), lucide-react (ISC), uqr (MIT). Full licence texts are in
each package under node_modules.
